  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff6b9e8f0cf7af0f",
      "translationZh": "我一直在 Intel 硬件上试验本地 LLM，并且想要一个经过极致优化、不依赖庞大 Python 后端的独立 CLI 工具。因此，我使用 OpenVINO GenAI 库，完全用 C++ 构建了 XeBoostLM。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9566a1714c061e2b",
      "translationZh": "它专门面向 Intel Core Ultra NPU（AI Boost）、Arc 集成 GPU 和 CPU，在生成过程中没有任何 Python 开销。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7fdcb6d36e4ded0",
      "translationZh": "[GitHub 链接：github.com/balaragavan2007/XeBoostLM ]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "516b54d4a6d2e325",
      "translationZh": "以下是它目前具备的功能：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "15227de3b499d014",
      "translationZh": "原生 C++ 执行：通过 MSVC 编译。资源占用极低。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "79a8d3432f45bb0f",
      "translationZh": "智能硬件路由：手动指定 NPU、GPU 或 CPU，或者让它以 HYBRID 模式运行，以平衡吞吐量和主机响应能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8cef450ca69d6322",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 兼容服务器：运行 xeboost serve，即可立即启动支持 Server-Sent Events（SSE）流式传输的 HTTP 服务器。开箱即用，可直接接入 Open WebUI 和 LibreChat。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "89b54f2ab9b6152b",
      "translationZh": "动态目录：xeboost pull 使用缓存的远程目录，自动获取并校验经过优化的 INT4/INT8 模型（Qwen 2.5、Phi-3.5、Llama 3.2、DeepSeek R1）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f1ab046c3eededbb",
      "translationZh": "终端 REPL：运行 xeboost chat <model>，即可直接在 CLI 中进行多轮对话。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "47699696348b6126",
      "translationZh": "这是 v0.1.2 版本。我刚刚让自动化的 GitHub 目录和 REST API 稳定下来。非常希望使用 Intel 芯片的朋友来测试一下，试用 CLI，或者将它接入自己的前端，并告诉我它的表现如何！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f1d475750d51be25",
      "translationZh": "非常欢迎反馈、功能请求或 PR。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
